      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why? It seems to me this is more like indicating whether the private dns probe has succeeded.\nBecause in setNetworkValid(), we have:\n\nif (isStrictMode) {\n    probesSucceeded |\u003d NETWORK_VALIDATION_PROBE_PRIVDNS;\n}",
